  "goodToKnow": "Der Marmor is marble, the stone: ein Marmorboden, eine Marmorstatue. Der Marmorkuchen (marble cake), with its swirls of chocolate and vanilla sponge, is a classic of German Kaffee und Kuchen. Playing marbles are die Murmeln. Germany's Walhalla memorial near Regensburg, modelled on the Parthenon, houses marble busts of famous Germans. It has no plural in normal use."
